Step 3: 扫描新机会（两阶段扫描）","Phase A: Quick Scan（3 品种 × 3 周期，不读 S 文件）","Scalp 快速通道（不进 Phase B，< 30 秒决策）","Phase B: 深分析（仅有事件的品种）","3d. 快速放弃条件（详见 S5 评估 + S6-channel / S6-bo 入场）","3d-2. PASS 分类 + 反恐惧硬检查","3d-3. SL 打掉后重新入场","3e. 自我验证（下单前必做，10 项全过）","3f. 执行开仓（含加仓路由）","Step 5: 定时器（智能动态间隔）","强制全刷新（Anti-Stale 机制）","pre_signal 超时（按周期区分）"],"reference_modes":{"C0-foundations.md":"full","C5-step5-dynamic-timing.md":"full","C1-market-cycle-and-state.md":"full","C2-triggers-and-reversal-taxonomy.md":"full","C3-style-equation-and-order-planning.md":"full","S0-daily-bias.md":"full","S1-reading.md":"full","S3b-key-levels.md":"full","S5-evaluation.md":"full","S6-common.md":"full","S6-channel.md":"full","S6-tr.md":"full","S6-reversal.md":"full"},"full_reference_count":13},"prompt_references":["C0-foundations.md","C5-step5-dynamic-timing.md","C1-market-cycle-and-state.md","C2-triggers-and-reversal-taxonomy.md","C3-style-equation-and-order-planning.md","S0-daily-bias.md","S1-reading.md","S3b-key-levels.md","S5-evaluation.md","S6-common.md","S6-channel.md","S6-tr.md","S6-reversal.md"],"needs_post_trade_refresh":false},"next_scan_seconds":90,"next_scan_reason":"BTC 反转试探挂单需要快速跟踪是否触发或失效；ETH 与 BNB 也都在顶部失败/接受临界区。","references":["C0-foundations.md","C5-step5-dynamic-timing.md","C1-market-cycle-and-state.md","C2-triggers-and-reversal-taxonomy.md","C3-style-equation-and-order-planning.md","S0-daily-bias.md","S1-reading.md","S3b-key-levels.md","S5-evaluation.md","S6-common.md","S6-channel.md","S6-tr.md","S6-reversal.md"],"explanation":{"summary":"本轮最大的变化是 BTC：它不再只是‘旧 long 计划失效后的观察’，而是已经发展成可执行的空头反转试探。ETH 仍未给出新 trigger，BNB 继续只观察顶部失败。","decision_basis":["S0：三品种的日线背景都不给强多顺风，BTC/BNB 是区间偏空，ETH 是空头通道偏空。","S1：BTC 近 20 根里 30m bear reversal bar 扩大，且 1h 重新回到 EMA 下方，明显区别于 ETH 与 BNB。","S3b：BTC 在 67393.6 顶部磁体附近 failed，当前 67234.57 变成上方压力，67085.4 成为 stop-entry 触发位。","S5：BTC 空头 probe 的 P 与 R 在轻仓前提下已达最低标准；ETH 与 BNB 当前都还缺 trigger。","S6-tr / S6-reversal：BTC 更符合 Failed BO Fade / DT 测试失败逻辑，但按 Brooks 原则这仍只是 reversal probe，不是 swing short。"],"conflict_resolution":["冲突点一：runtime 缓存里 BTC 仍是‘watching’，但 canonical 的 thesis 切换原则要求：当旧 bull continuation 明显失败且新的反向 trigger 出现后，应从观察升级为可执行的反转试探。这里按 canonical 优先。","冲突点二：quick_scan 里有 wedge_or_mtr 背景标签，但 Brooks 明确坏楔形不是 setup。本轮的 BTC 空单不是因为楔形，而是因为 failed BO fade + 在 1h EMA 下方的接受开始出现。","冲突点三：如果只看 S6-channel，可能会继续把 BTC 当成高位等待重建的顺势多头；但 canonical 的 reversal 升级原则要求在 failed continuation 后及时切换 thesis。本轮明确按 canonical 更高层规则执行。"],"al_brooks_notes_applied":["大多数反转都来自 DT/DB 测试，本轮 BTC 的空头是顶部 DT 测试失败后的 reversal probe。","MTR/反转一开始只有约 40% 胜率，因此 BTC 只做 0.3% 的反转试探，不直接当成 swing。","通道反转优先 stop orders，不用 limit，因此 BTC 使用 STOP_MARKET。","Scalp 先行，Swing 等更清晰接受，所以 BTC 只有在 1h 连续收在触发位下方后才考虑升级。"],"conflict_check":"本轮没有 canonical rulebook 与 patrol-l1 原文的硬冲突；主要是 canonical 允许在 BTC failed continuation 后更快完成 thesis 切换与执行。"},"render_status":{"cycle_card":{"ok":true,"skipped":false},"pre_signal":[{"symbol":"BTCUSDT","ok":true,"skipped":false},{"symbol":"ETHUSDT","ok":true,"skipped":false},{"symbol":"BNBUSDT","ok":true,"skipped":false}],"housekeeping":{"ok":true,"skipped":true,"reason":"not_due"}},"push_status":{"cycle_card":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","dryRun":false,"handledBy":"plugin","payload":{"ok":true,"messageId":"1337","chatId":"-1003512657369"},"photo":{"mode":"direct_bot_api","ok":true,"result":{"message_id":1338,"from":{"id":8251154620,"is_bot":true,"first_name":"OpenClaw","username":"chunboClawd_bot"},"chat":{"id":-1003512657369,"title":"OpenClaw","is_forum":true,"type":"supergroup"},"date":1773001191,"message_thread_id":3,"reply_to_message":{"message_id":3,"from":{"id":756069822,"is_bot":false,"first_name":"MITCHELL","last_name":"CB","username":"MITCHELLCB","language_code":"zh-hans"},"chat":{"id":-1003512657369,"title":"OpenClaw","is_forum":true,"type":"supergroup"},"date":1769987079,"message_thread_id":3,"forum_topic_created":{"name":"al broos管理系统","icon_color":16749490},"is_topic_message":true},"photo":[{"file_id":"AgACAgUAAyEGAATRXuXZAAIFOmmt2edEWebtOzfwHvTw36Ren